      "process_md": "**Step 1:** Visit the official [website](https://smartbijlee.mpez.co.in/view/ltnsc/lt_nsc_mukhyamantri_krushak_mitra_yojana_home_page.php). \n**Step 2:** Choose the applicant type and proceed with the &amp;quot;Click Here&amp;quot; option.\n**Step 3:** Fill in all the required details in the online application form.\n**Step 4:** Verify the details, accept the Terms &amp;amp; Conditions, then click on &amp;quot;Submit&amp;quot;.\n<br>\n\n"
