    "label": "In Kind",
    "value": "in-kind"
  },
  "benefits": "\n- **Cost Sharing Support:** Only 50% of the infrastructure development cost will be borne by the concerned farmer or group of farmers.\n\n- **Government Grant:** 40% of the cost will be provided directly by the State Government to the power distribution company as a grant.\n<br>\n\n",
