  "detailed_description": "The scheme “Mukhyamantri Krushak Mitra Yojana” launched by the Energy Department, Government of Madhya Pradesh, aims to create infrastructure for permanent agricultural pump connections through the distribution company. The scheme provides grants and cost-sharing support to farmers and distribution companies for infrastructure development.\n<br>\n\n",
  "eligibility": "\n- The applicant should be a landholding farmer/group-farmer.\n\n<br>\n\n",
